# Proof of Valor (WotG 21), Hauberliond's trade. Crossbow Bolts x99 before the trigger play nothing; the trigger plays
# 130 (Remind bit 2), then 140. Trades of 98 bolts or with a Flint Stone play nothing. x99, x198 and x297 play 134 and
# add 9, 10 and 11 to Option (the bolts are removed); the first sets Status bit 16, and the later trades add again with
# the bit already set. With bit 16 set the last trigger gets Hauberliond's DefaultActions event 92.
